::  name       brush frame field count
::  shape      fields - int (@u32)
::  invariant  BrushFrame carries three fields: at_nib · max_lines · lines
::  example    3
::  readers    Brushstroke · Surface · .brush lower · Skate grid
::  nib        surface-p44-v0
::
::  Surface Season p44 — tenth pedestal in src/sur (structure museum).
::  Names BrushFrame in brushstroke/brush_parse.rye (three fields).
::  Does not invent a Wayland window · surf/ graduation · or Realidream invent.
+$  brush-frame-field-count-shape
  $:  fields=@u32
  ==
